        "created_at": "2022-03-19T22:21:23.395Z",
        "cooked": "<p>What’s the coolest thing you’ve done with a Collection while playing a Definitive Edition event?</p>\n<p>I just used Dark Twistings (collected from the Wayward Sun event) to have Fanatic activate the power on Absolution, at 3 HP, with Anoint Allies in play.</p>\n<p>3+3+1<br>\n2+3+1<br>\n2+3+1<br>\n= 19 total damage!</p>",
