        "created_at": "2022-03-20T02:54:26.466Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I don’t typically use them, but as I was fighting advanced Akash’Mecha, I realized near the end of the fight that I had read the advanced rules wrong… instead of placing 1 card from the environment under her each turn, I had been placing 3!</p>\n<p>… Thankfully, I had Fanatic in play. And so I simply used both Collections to get her Aegis back into play twice! So, she effectively prevented 10+ damage hits, three rounds in a row (and healed from them).</p>",
